WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
Yeah, sisters

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,200
look who's coming

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,300
Are you having bad luck today?

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,400
Didn't find anything to eat

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,300
Came here smelling the aroma of our grilled crabs

6
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,700
It’s not impossible to eat if you want to

7
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,200
Apologize to all our ladies first and promise later

8
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,500
All the hard work of cutting firewood and picking coconuts is yours

9
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,700
We can consider sharing a little bit between you and me

10
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,300
Come on, you guys can eat and drink together.

11
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,500
Otherwise, why are you here?

12
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,100
You were just lucky in the past two days

13
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,400
Blind cat meets dead mouse

14
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,300
Survive alone

15
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,800
When luck runs out

16
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,830
Do you regret it now? It’s nothing.

17
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,030
Just two pheasants

18
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,620
pheasant

19
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:33,020
And blueberry banana

20
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,420
Why do I suddenly feel that the grilled crab in my hand is not fragrant at all? Xue Ya

21
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:37,420
What you said is really right

22
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,620
Your grilled crabs really don’t smell like mine.

23
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:40,820
There's nothing good to eat at night

24
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,220
I can only eat some chicken and go about my days, right?

25
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,920
Who just asked me to come back and apologize first?

26
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:47,720
I'll continue to work as a coolie for you, forget it. I have a bad memory.

27
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,720
You take your time and eat a big meal while you work hard on your own.
